Channel layout names (src/channel-layout-name.ts)

src/channel-layout-name.ts adapts the channel_names and channel_layout_map
tables and the native-order branch of av_channel_layout_describe (with
av_channel_name_bprint's USR<id> fallback) from FFmpeg
libavutil/channel_layout.c.

Fixed FFmpeg commit:946fcce07b6dcd0331c8cc609192aeff5e1924f8
