The TypeScript adaptation describes a 64-bit native-order mask only: no custom
or ambisonic orders, no parsing, and no FFmpeg runtime code. The layout table is
checked against `ffmpeg -layouts` of the pinned reference build. The original
source and full notices remain in the pinned upstream submodule.
